1
00:00:00,153 --> 00:00:01,723
(Sheldon:)Take me to Leonard.

2
00:00:01,721 --> 00:00:03,821
(Amy:)Just go to work,
he'll be fine.

3
00:00:03,823 --> 00:00:06,563
(Sheldon:)Amy, he's my best friend,
and if you don't take me,

4
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:08,060
(Sheldon:)I'm going there anyway.

5
00:00:08,061 --> 00:00:11,231
(Sheldon:)Fine.

6
00:00:11,231 --> 00:00:14,001
(Amy:)It's sweet that you
care about him so much.

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,070
(Sheldon:)I do.

8
00:00:15,068 --> 00:00:16,898
(Sheldon:)And I wouldn't
be able to forgive myself,

9
00:00:16,903 --> 00:00:19,003
(Sheldon:)if something happened to him
and I wasn't at his bedside

10
00:00:19,005 --> 00:00:21,105
to say, "I told you so."

11
00:00:35,855 --> 00:00:36,885
(Amy:)Hello.

12
00:00:36,890 --> 00:00:38,860
(Penny:)We had a really nice swim.

13
00:00:38,858 --> 00:00:40,028
(Sheldon:)Oh, stop it.

14
00:00:40,026 --> 00:00:43,526
(Sheldon:)I assume this medical
center's already treated

15
00:00:43,530 --> 00:00:46,330
(Sheldon:)the burns on your bottom
from the recent pants fire.

16
00:00:47,867 --> 00:00:49,897
'Cause I'm a liar, liar?

17
00:00:49,903 --> 00:00:52,003
(Sheldon:)That's for the fire marshal
to determine.

18
00:00:53,907 --> 00:00:54,937
(Penny:)You had to tell him?

19
00:00:54,941 --> 00:00:56,711
(Amy:)He wore me down.

